            "review_title": "Review at OHay Bar & Pizza Lo",
            "review_text": "Eyekaytoo\nLeverkusen, Germany3234 contributions\n0\nNice enough place for a quiet afternoon cool beer\nApr 2026 • Solo\nOn my short walking tour back from the Furama resort area to My Khe beach I stopped off here for a cool, draft local beer. It being late afternoon, the place was practically empty. The serving staff were sitting around studying their Smartphones but a young lady did help me by adjusting the ventilator fan over my seat and taking my order of a large glass of local beer. This is quite a big place with a decent menu, large bar area with some large TV screens and decent, relatively clean restrooms. I guess that this place is busier in the evenings.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 6, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
